  "date": "2026-09-26",
  "description": "Intake questions asked by the CareFlow kiosk or phone. Each linkId is the StructuredFacts path it fills. Items with the audience extension set to nurse are answered by the nurse. English only; Arabic text arrives through the translation extension in M2-03 (the title shows the pattern). Research prototype; synthetic data only; not for clinical use.",
